  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that energy density&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;should be dimensionless, the dimensions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;should be same.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mstyle></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>U</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>U</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
